---
// EarlifyHero.astro - Hero Premium Dark Medical Cyber-Clean para Earlify Health
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section id="earlify-hero" class="hero-native-section" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <!-- Layered Ambient Backdrop & Metaphor -->
  <div class="hero-backdrop-layer" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ambient-glow glow-cyan"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow glow-purple"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow glow-emerald"></div>

    <!-- Visual Metaphor: Conceptual artwork of continuity -->
    <div class="metaphor-artwork-wrapper">
      <img 
        src={`${baseUrl}/assets/earlify-hero-metaphor.jpg`} 
        alt="Metáfora visual de continuidad clínica y familiar en Earlify Health" 
        class="metaphor-artwork-img"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div class="metaphor-gradient-mask"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-grid-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero-container">
    <!-- Brand Logo & Mascot Anchor -->
    <div class="hero-brand-bar">
      <div class="hero-logo-container">
        <img 
          src={`${baseUrl}/assets/earlify-logo.png`} 
          alt="Logotipo Oficial de Earlify Health S.L." 
          class="hero-brand-logo" 
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="hero-mascot-pill" aria-label="Mascota interactiva oficial Lúa">
        <img 
          src={`${baseUrl}/assets/lua-mascota-valeria.png`} 
          alt="Lúa, mascota del ecosistema pediátrico Earlify" 
          class="mascot-mini-thumb"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <div class="mascot-pill-text">
          <span class="mascot-name">Lúa AIoT</span>
          <span class="mascot-sub">Puente afectivo</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Header & Main Heading -->
    <div class="hero-header-content">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
        <span>SALUD DIGITAL INFANTIL · CONSULTA, AULA Y HOGAR</span>
      </div>

      <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero-title">
        Uniendo la precisión médica con la calidez del hogar, <span class="text-gradient-cyan">para que ningún niño se quede atrás.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-lead">
        Conectamos la valoración diagnóstica en consulta con la pedagogía en el aula y la estimulación guiada diaria en casa mediante un ecosistema riguroso, seguro y 100% offline.
      </p>

      <!-- Institutional Thesis / Motto Box -->
      <div class="hero-motto-card">
        <div class="motto-quote-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="motto-body">
          <p class="motto-text">
            «Un mismo criterio. Mejor continuidad. Earlify no sustituye el juicio profesional ni el de la familia. Lo ordena y le da continuidad.»
          </p>
          <span class="motto-author">Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso · Fundador &amp; CEO de Earlify Health</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Integrated Institutional Authority Badges (Micro-SVGs) -->
      <div class="hero-badges-row" aria-label="Avales institucionales y acreditaciones">
        <span class="authority-badge badge-starttic">
          <svg class="badge-svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
          <span class="badge-text"><strong>startTIC</strong> Alta Tecnología (Zona Franca Vigo · Gradiant · FEDER)</span>
        </span>
        <span class="authority-badge badge-itemas">
          <svg class="badge-svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="badge-text"><strong>Sello ITEMAS-ISCIII 2024</strong></span>
        </span>
        <span class="authority-badge badge-usc">
          <svg class="badge-svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path>
            <path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="badge-text"><strong>Universidade de Santiago de Compostela</strong> (USC)</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Action CTAs -->
      <div class="hero-cta-actions">
        <a href="#explorador-interactivo" class="btn-primary-hero">
          <span>Explorar los 4 Pilares</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 17l10-10M17 17V7H7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <button 
          type="button"
          id="open-contact-modal-hero" 
          class="btn-secondary-hero"
          onclick="document.getElementById('contact-modal')?.classList.add('open'); document.getElementById('contact-modal')?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');"
        >
          <span>Agendar Piloto Clínico</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/>
            <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The 4 Pillars Matrix (Consulta, Aula, Hogar, Hardware) -->
    <div class="hero-quad-grid" aria-label="Los cuatro pilares del ecosistema Earlify">
      <!-- Pillar 1: VIA+ (Consulta) -->
      <a href="#explorador-interactivo" class="trilogy-card card-via" data-tab-trigger="via">
        <div class="card-badge tag-cyan">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
          <span>En Consulta Médica</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">VIA+ <span class="card-subtitle">(SaMD Clase IIa)</span></h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Evaluación clínica objetiva con 13 módulos foniátricos, DSP Praat C++ y Cero IA en runtime.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="pill-mini">MDR Regla 11</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">DSP Praat C++</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">7 Lenguas</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Pillar 2: Descubre con Lúa (Aula Escolar) -->
      <a href="#explorador-interactivo" class="trilogy-card card-descubre" data-tab-trigger="descubre">
        <div class="card-badge tag-emerald">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg>
          <span>En el Aula Escolar</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Descubre con Lúa <span class="card-subtitle">(0–3 Años)</span></h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Rutinas de asamblea con metrónomo visual silencioso para hipoacusia y cero pantallas directas.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="pill-mini">10 Unidades Aula</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">Pulso Visual</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">1.020 Locuciones</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Pillar 3: Valeria+ (Hogar) -->
      <a href="#explorador-interactivo" class="trilogy-card card-valeria" data-tab-trigger="valeria">
        <div class="card-badge tag-purple">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
          <span>En el Hogar y la Familia</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Valeria+ <span class="card-subtitle">(DM Clase I)</span></h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Estimulación auditivo-verbal diaria con método TPR en 10 bloques 100% offline y Academy.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="pill-mini">10 Bloques TPR</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">4.711 Locuciones</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">Academy ASHA</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Pillar 4: Lúa (Hardware Conectivo) -->
      <a href="#explorador-interactivo" class="trilogy-card card-lua" data-tab-trigger="lua">
        <div class="card-badge tag-orange">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect></svg>
          <span>Hardware &amp; Afecto</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Lúa <span class="card-subtitle">(Hardware AIoT V1)</span></h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Mascota física circular GC9A01 (ESP32-C3) con estricto silencio clínico en consulta y descanso 20-20-20.
        </p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="pill-mini">Sin Micrófonos</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">Zero-PHI</span>
          <span class="pill-mini">USC Ender-3</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  function initHeroModalListener() {
    const contactBtn = document.getElementById('open-contact-modal-hero');
    const modal = document.getElementById('contact-modal');
    if (contactBtn && modal) {
      contactBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        modal.classList.add('open');
        modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      });
    }
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initHeroModalListener);
  } else {
    initHeroModalListener();
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initHeroModalListener);
</script>

<style>
  /* Native Flow Modern Hero Section */
  .hero-native-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: clamp(86px, 11vh, 120px);
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark, #07090e);
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Layered Ambient Backdrop */
  .hero-backdrop-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ambient-glow {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .glow-cyan {
    top: -5%;
    left: -5%;
    width: clamp(280px, 40vw, 550px);
    height: clamp(280px, 40vw, 550px);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(70px);
  }

  .glow-purple {
    top: 15%;
    right: -5%;
    width: clamp(300px, 45vw, 600px);
    height: clamp(300px, 45vw, 600px);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(80px);
  }

  .glow-emerald {
    bottom: -5%;
    left: 20%;
    width: clamp(250px, 35vw, 450px);
    height: clamp(250px, 35vw, 450px);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(70px);
  }

  .metaphor-artwork-wrapper {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5%;
    right: 0;
    width: clamp(280px, 45vw, 600px);
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.15;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .metaphor-artwork-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .metaphor-gradient-mask {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%, transparent 30%, var(--bg-dark, #07090e) 85%);
  }

  .hero-grid-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 40px 40px;
    z-index: 2;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, black 40%, transparent 80%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, black 40%, transparent 80%);
  }

  /* Main Container */
  .hero-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Brand Bar with Mascot Pill */
  .hero-brand-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .hero-logo-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-brand-logo {
    width: clamp(92px, 18vw, 120px);
    height: clamp(92px, 18vw, 120px);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
  }

  .hero-mascot-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem 0.35rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .mascot-mini-thumb {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: contain;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
  }

  .mascot-pill-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .mascot-name {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fbbf24;
  }

  .mascot-sub {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
  }

  /* Editorial Header */
  .hero-header-content {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
    color: #00f2fe;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    white-space: normal;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #00f2fe;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00f2fe;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    word-break: break-word;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .text-gradient-cyan {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  /* Institutional Motto Card */
  .hero-motto-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.28);
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;
    max-width: 760px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .motto-quote-icon {
    color: #c084fc;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .motto-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .motto-text {
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1.6vw, 1rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .motto-author {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #c084fc;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* Authority Badges */
  .hero-badges-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .authority-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.35;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .badge-svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .badge-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .badge-starttic {
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    color: #e0f2fe;
  }
  .badge-starttic .badge-svg { color: #00f2fe; }

  .badge-itemas {
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    color: #d1fae5;
  }
  .badge-itemas .badge-svg { color: #10b981; }

  .badge-usc {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
    color: #f3e8ff;
  }
  .badge-usc .badge-svg { color: #c084fc; }

  /* Action Buttons */
  .hero-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .btn-primary-hero {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%);
    color: #041017;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary-hero:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.55);
  }

  .btn-secondary-hero {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .btn-secondary-hero:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* 4 Pillars Matrix (Quad Grid) */
  .hero-quad-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .trilogy-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: left;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .trilogy-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .card-via:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4); }
  .card-descubre:hover { border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); }
  .card-valeria:hover { border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4); }
  .card-lua:hover { border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4); }

